<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"> <head> <meta charset="utf-8"> <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes" name="viewport"> <title>crossrefs</title> </head> <body> <main> <h1 id="sec:overview">1 Cross-reference smoke case</h1> <p>The result is shown in Figure <a href="#fig:trend">1</a> and summarized in Table <a href="#tbl:values">1</a>. The model is defined by Equation <a href="#eq:circle">1</a>.</p> <figure id="fig:trend"> <img alt="Figure 1 A small deterministic trend figure." src="figure.svg"> <figcaption aria-hidden="true">Figure 1 A small deterministic trend figure.</figcaption> </figure> <table data-alignment="center" data-cell_margin="0.10cm" data-revision_rows="2" id="tbl:values"> <caption>Table 1 Cross-reference values.</caption> <colgroup> <col> <col> </colgroup> <thead> <tr> <th>Value</th> <th>Meaning</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">1</td> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">baseline</td> </tr> <tr> <td>2</td> <td>candidate</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <div data-revision="true"> <p>
<span id="eq:circle">
<span class="display math"> x^2 + y^2 = r^2 \tag{1}</span>
</span>
</p> </div> <p>The conclusion returns to Section <a href="#sec:overview">1</a>.</p> </main> </body> </html>
